【Kudirat Abubakar】
== Reference ==
Kudirat Abubakar (1945 – June 14, 1996) was a Nigerian social activist, politician, and entrepreneur. She was the wife of military leader and former head of state, General Abubakar Tafawa Balewa. She was assassinated in 1996 by the military regime of General Sani Abacha.

